    <string name="about_title">Mabapi le WeatherWise</string>
    <string name="about_version">WeatherWise v1.0</string>
    <string name="about_description">WeatherWise ke mothusi oa hao ea hlollang bakeng sa litlhahiso tsa boemo ba leholimo ka nako ea nnete le lipontšo tse nepahetseng. E hahiloe ka tlhokomelo ea ho nepahala le boiphihlelo ba basebelisi, re u fa maemo a morao-rao a sebelisa litšebeletso tsa AccuWeather tse etellang pele.</string>
